//mangabeira.net\",\n        \"image\": \"https://mangabeira.net/images/gabriel-professional-about.png\",\n        \"jobTitle\": \"Web3 Growth Marketing Strategist\",\n        \"description\": \"Growth marketing expert specializing in Web3, DeFi, and tokenomics. Former growth lead at Binance and IOC.\",\n        \"sameAs\": [\n          \"https://x.com/manga82\",\n          \"https://linkedin.com/in/mangabeira\"\n        ],\n        \"alumniOf\": [\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n            \"name\": \"University of Florida\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n            \"name\": \"Coca-Cola Company\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n            \"name\": \"Binance\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n            \"name\": \"International Olympic Committee\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"knowsAbout\": [\n          \"Web3 Marketing\",\n          \"Tokenomics\",\n          \"DeFi\",\n          \"NFT Strategy\",\n          \"Community Building\",\n          \"Growth Marketing\",\n          \"AI Product Development\",\n          \"No-Code Tools\",\n          \"Crypto Analytics\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n        \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n        \"name\": \"Mangabeira.net\",\n        \"url\": \"https://mangabeira.net\",\n        \"logo\": \"https://mangabeira.net/images/swimming-icon.png\",\n        \"description\": \"Web3 growth marketing expertise and consulting for DeFi, NFT, and token projects\",\n        \"founder\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Person\",\n          \"name\": \"Gabriel Mangabeira\"\n        },\n        \"sameAs\": [\n          \"https://x.com/manga82\",\n          \"https://linkedin.com/in/mangabeira\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n        \"@type\": \"VideoObject\",\n        \"name\": \"Token Health Scan Launch Video\",\n        \"description\": \"Mockumentary ad for Token Health Scan styled like The Office, featuring a clueless intern, deadpan founder, and crypto cat\",\n        \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://img.youtube.com/vi/5-GSuM5nrnY/maxresdefault.jpg\",\n        \"uploadDate\": \"2025-11-07\",\n        \"contentUrl\": \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5-GSuM5nrnY\",\n        \"embedUrl\": \"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5-GSuM5nrnY\",\n        \"duration\": \"PT2M30S\"\n      }\n    ]\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<article class=\"prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert max-w-none\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold\">So Many Tabs Open</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-muted-foreground\">If you've spent more than five minutes trying to research a token, you know the pain.</p><p>You open seven tabs. Bounce between charts, contract scanners, GitHub, Twitter.</p><p>And still end up guessing whether a project is legit, or just dressed-up vaporware.</p><div class=\"my-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-l-amber-500 bg-amber-50/50 dark:bg-amber-950/20 p-6\"><p class=\"font-semibold\">Here's the kicker: 98% of tokens fail.</p><p class=\"text-sm\">Not because the tech is bad — but because nobody trusts them.</p></div><p>That's the problem I wanted to solve.</p><p>So I built <strong>Token Health Scan</strong> — a clean, fast, Web3-native tool to help you DYOR without losing your mind (or your wallet).</p><h2 id=\"what\" class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-12\">What Is Token Health Scan?</h2><p>Token Health Scan is a <strong>free + pro-tier web app</strong> that lets anyone scan any token by name or address.</p><div class=\"my-6 rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-4\">Get a 5-pillar health score:</h3><ul class=\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3\"><li>🛡️ Security</li><li>💰 Liquidity</li><li>📈 Tokenomics</li><li>👥 Community</li><li>🔀 Development</li></ul></div><p>Instantly spot red flags and trust signals.</p><p>Whether you're a degen, a builder, or someone in-between, this tool gets you signal fast.</p><h2 id=\"how\" class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-12\">How It Works (In Plain English)</h2><p>Here's the full user journey:</p><ol class=\"space-y-4 my-6\"><li><strong>1. Search</strong> - Type any token name or address</li><li><strong>2. Match</strong> - The tool auto-finds it in the CoinGecko database</li><li><strong>3. Scan Loads</strong> - Crypto trivia runs while it crunches data</li><li><strong>4. Results</strong> - Token dashboard with overview scores and deep dive tabs</li><li><strong>5. Upgrade Prompt</strong> - After 3 scans, you can unlock full access with Pro</li></ol><p>It's basically a full health checkup, but for tokens — minus the pain of spreadsheets and forums.</p><h2 id=\"tech\" class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-12\">What Powers It</h2><p>I built the MVP using <strong>Lovable</strong> — an AI product builder that lets you ship without touching a line of code.</p><div class=\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 my-6\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border p-4\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Frontend</h4><p class=\"text-sm\">Lovable</p></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border p-4\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Backend</h4><p class=\"text-sm\">Supabase</p></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border p-4\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Payments</h4><p class=\"text-sm\">Stripe</p></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border p-4\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">APIs</h4><p class=\"text-sm\">CoinGecko, GoPlus, GeckoTerminal, GitHub, Apify/X</p></div></div><p>A lot of prompts, multiple iterations, and a couple hundred credits later…the first version was live.</p><h2 id=\"launch\" class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-12\">How I Launched It</h2><p>Just tweeting \"I built a thing\" doesn't work anymore.</p><p>So I tried something different: A <strong>mockumentary ad</strong> made with Veo3, styled like The Office but set inside a crypto startup.</p><div class=\"my-6 rounded-lg border p-6\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold mb-4\">Featuring:</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li>• A clueless intern</li><li>• A deadpan founder</li><li>• A crypto cat in sunglasses 😎</li></ul></div><p>All powered by AI — no scriptwriters, no camera crew. Just a clear vibe and good storytelling.</p><div class=\"my-8 aspect-video rounded-lg border overflow-hidden\"><iframe class=\"w-full h-full\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5-GSuM5nrnY\" title=\"Token Health Scan Launch Video\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-12\">What's Next (The Roadmap)</h2><p>I'm just getting started.</p><div class=\"my-6 rounded-lg border p-6\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold mb-4\">Here's what we're building next:</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li>• Multi-chain support (starting with Solana + Arbitrum)</li><li>• Founder wallet visibility + KYC checks</li><li>• Alerts when token scores change</li></ul></div><p>If you've got feature ideas — I'm all ears.</p><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mt-12\">Try It + Share Feedback</h2><p>I'm building in public and tweaking based on real usage.</p><div class=\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 my-6\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border p-6\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Try Token Health Scan</h4><a href=\"https://tokenhealthscan.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\">tokenhealthscan.com →</a></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border p-6\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Follow for updates + scans</h4><a href=\"https://twitter.com/manga82\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\">@manga82 on Twitter (X) →</a></div></div><p>Got feature requests? Questions? Feedback? Drop a comment or DM me. Let's fix DYOR, together.</p><div class=\"my-12 rounded-lg border-2 border-primary bg-primary/5 p-8 text-center\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Want to Build Your Own AI-Powered Tool?</h3><p class=\"mb-6 text-lg\">Let's discuss how you can launch products faster using AI and no-code tools.</p><a href=\"https://mangabeira.net/services/web3-growth-audit\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2.5 bg-gradient-cta text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:brightness-110 transition-all\">Run the Growth Audit →</a></div></article>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
